WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Time to the minute

2
00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:09.767
Selam walks to school every morning. Let us read the clock together.

3
00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.400
The short hand is just past seven, so the hour is seven.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.033
The long hand is on the four: counting by fives, that is twenty minutes.

5
00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:20.667
The time is seven twenty; in Ethiopian time it is twenty past one in the morning.

6
00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:24.600
Forty minutes later it is eight o'clock, and school begins.
